          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "yJaae",
              "name": "Kicker",
              "fill": "$logo-ember",
              "content": "FOODY  ·  ROUND 2  ·  16 SQUARE MARKS",
              "fontFamily": "DM Sans",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 2.6
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "DRtOC",
              "name": "Board Title",
              "fill": "$logo-ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The word is the mark.",
              "lineHeight": 1.05,
              "fontFamily": "Poppins",
              "fontSize": 54,
              "fontWeight": "800"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "yzERa",
              "name": "Board Sub",
              "fill": "$logo-mist",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 980,
              "content": "No icon parked above a label. In every concept the letterforms of “Foody” are cut open and rebuilt out of the things a food event is made of — a plate, a table with seats, a toast, a pinned address, a ticket, a lifted cloche. The double-o is the engine: it is the one place a word can hold an object and still read as a word. Each tile is shown again at 72px, real app-icon scale, as an honest legibility check.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "DM Sans",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "PfSUF",
